  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "On an island in the turbulent flow sea area, Ying Wu Xie leads Hei Lou Lan, Tai Bai Yun Sheng, and Shi Nu into a five floored palace Immortal Gu House dug under the island. He says Shadow Sect found a tributary of the River of Time there, placed the house, and draws on that tributary to refine Gu, so Immortal Gu refine themselves from time to time.",
      "chapters": [
        1103
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_turbulent_flow",
        "char_ying_wu_xie",
        "char_hei_lou_lan",
        "char_tai_bai_yun_sheng",
        "char_shi_nu",
        "sys_immortal_gu_house",
        "fac_shadow_sect",
        "loc_tributary_of_the_river_of_time",
        "sys_immortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Tai Bai Yun Sheng asks whether the house is the legendary Regret Pool. Ying Wu Xie answers that it is only most of Regret Pool: it keeps the Gu refinement aspect, but attack and defense are horrible, and once placed it cannot be moved. Tai Bai Yun Sheng names three great pools famous in the history of the five regions, Heavenly Pool, Regret Pool, and Wine Pool. Ying Wu Xie adds that Regret Pool is a time path Immortal Gu House: when Shadow Sect Gu Immortals refine Immortal Gu there successfully they leave an insignia, and when that Immortal Gu is destroyed the pool can use the River of Time tributary and the insignia to refine it again at about fifty to sixty percent success.",
      "chapters": [
        1103
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_heavenly_pool",
        "loc_wine_pool",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "loc_river_of_time"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Deviation (recorded): this page is filed under gu-houses because Regret Pool is a named Immortal Gu House. The Shadow Sect remnant shown in chapter 1103 is a fixed installation under a turbulent flow island, not a five-region map seat.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "The Immortal Gu offered from the house are ones destroyed in the battle of Yi Tian Mountain. In the days before that meeting, Immortal Gu House Regret Pool activated, using the left insignias and the River of Time tributary to refine those Immortal Gu again. Most results are soul path; time path attempts fail; there are no strength path Immortal Gu because Da Li left no insignia before Regret Pool was built.",
      "chapters": [
        1104
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "re-refinement-results",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_yi_tian_mountain",
        "char_da_li"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When Fang Yuan later reaches Ying Wu Xie’s former camp under another turbulent flow island, Regret Pool has already been taken apart, the surrounding Gu formations are gone, and the River of Time tributary Shadow Sect kept there is missing.",
      "chapters": [
        1158
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "camp-dismantling",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "sys_gu_formation"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After Shadow Sect is beaten down, twelve Immortal Gu House construction plans remain among its resources, and Regret Pool is named in that list.",
      "chapters": [
        1380
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "construction-plan-listing",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "When Fang Yuan later builds an incomplete Immortal Gu House, he takes reference from Regret Pool among many other Immortal Gu Houses, with the skeleton based on Graceful Chaotic Duel Stage.",
      "chapters": [
        1628
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "design-reference",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "house_graceful_chaotic_duel_stage"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan states that other than tributaries of the River of Time, Immortal Gu Regret is the core of Immortal Gu House Regret Pool. The Regret Pool left behind in Eastern Sea was half-complete and did not have Immortal Gu Regret.",
      "chapters": [
        1649
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "core-immortal-gu",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_regret_gu",
        "reg_eastern_sea"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Later narration again calls Regret Pool, Heavenly Pool, and Wine Pool the three legendary pools of the world, restates the insignia and River of Time tributary re-refinement at about fifty to sixty percent success, and treats Regret Pool as one Immortal Gu House model merged into Fang Yuan’s Four Elements Square Regret Blood Refinement Pool, with rank eight Immortal Gu Regret used as the essence of Regret Pool for a pavilion in that pool.",
      "chapters": [
        2077
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "merged-pool-model",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "house_four_elements_square_regret_blood_refinement_pool"
      ]
    }
  ],
